Description:

Sharing a mailbox, calendar or addressbook through JMAP (or a WebDAV ACL
request) now emits an AclChange event for each identifier whose rights
changed, as IMAP SETACL always has.


Documentation:

docsrc/concepts/features/event-notifications.rst


Config changes:

None


Upgrade instructions:

None.  Deployments that act on AclChange events will start seeing them for
JMAP sharing changes.  Their "user" field is empty, since the acting user is
not known at the point they are emitted.


GitHub issue:

None
